[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11340.389, "timestamp": "03:09:00", "text": "我不知道，伙计。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11342.51, "timestamp": "03:09:02", "text": "只是现在我有了这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11344.87, "timestamp": "03:09:04", "text": "雌雄莫辨的声音。我超喜欢这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11348.23, "timestamp": "03:09:08", "text": "嗓音。所以这听起来可能有点令人困惑"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11351.63, "timestamp": "03:09:11", "text": "对许多人来说。是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11354.55, "timestamp": "03:09:14", "text": "事物。哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11357.59, "timestamp": "03:09:17", "text": "是的。是的，他就是。我的天啊。但它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11359.91, "timestamp": "03:09:19", "text": "就像他在狂按技能键一样，但在光束模式下就只是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11365.19, "timestamp": "03:09:25", "text": "是的。我明白了。是的。在我的脑海里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11368.23, "timestamp": "03:09:28", "text": "他为什么一直给你发垃圾信息？你是个男的啊。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11370.389, "timestamp": "03:09:30", "text": "很多次？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11373.349, "timestamp": "03:09:33", "text": "我需要提交一个错误报告。我需要发送这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11377.51, "timestamp": "03:09:37", "text": "错误报告之类的东西。伙计们，看看这个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11380.469, "timestamp": "03:09:40", "text": "查看Beam聊天记录。这是垃圾邮件。一"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11383.349, "timestamp": "03:09:43", "text": "信息被大量发送。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11385.269, "timestamp": "03:09:45", "text": "是的。是的。仅限Twitch平台。不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11387.03, "timestamp": "03:09:47", "text": "YouTube消息。仅在Twitch平台播出。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11389.23, "timestamp": "03:09:49", "text": "YouTube是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11392.87, "timestamp": "03:09:52", "text": "不是。请不要让我们感到困惑。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11394.79, "timestamp": "03:09:54", "text": "不，不，他是个男的。别担心"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11397.269, "timestamp": "03:09:57", "text": "它。我们只是在撒尿。只是"}]